{"kind":"doc","route":"/learn/","title":"Learn @craft-ts","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"learn-craft-ts","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Learn @craft-ts"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This is the guided path. You build "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one app"}]},{"t":"text","text":", from an empty component to a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"routed, tested feature — adding exactly one idea per step."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If you are looking for a specific answer instead, go to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Guide"}]},{"t":"text","text":" (organised by task) or search."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-you-will-build","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What you will build"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A task list. It starts as three lines in a component and ends up with server"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"data, optimistic updates, URL state, a validated form, a typed route and tests."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Step"}],[{"t":"text","text":"What you add"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/01-first-state","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"1. Your first state"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"craftComponent"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"state"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/02-derive","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"2. Derive instead of duplicate"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"computed + methods"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/03-service","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"3. Move logic out of the component"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"craftService"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/04-compose","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"4. Compose services"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"generators, "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/05-load-data","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"5. Load server data"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"query"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/06-mutate-data","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"6. Write server data"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"mutation"},{"t":"text","text":", optimistic updates"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/07-url-state","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"7. Put state in the URL"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"queryParams"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/08-forms","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"8. Build a form"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"insertForm"},{"t":"text","text":", validators"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/09-routing","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"9. Wire up routing"}]}],[{"t":"code","text":"craftRoute"},{"t":"text","text":", compile-time DI check"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/10-testing","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"10. Test what you wrote"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"testing by register, architecture rules"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Then: "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/next","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Where to go next"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"before-you-start","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Before you start"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"You need a TypeScript application and Node.js 20.19+ (or 22.12+). No prior"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"knowledge of generators, RxJS or signals internals is required — each is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"introduced when it first earns its place."}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"tip","caption":"Read in order","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every step builds on the previous one's code. Skipping ahead works, but step 4"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is where the mental model clicks — don't skip that one."}]}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"warning","caption":"Experimental","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":" and this documentation are both experimental. APIs can still move"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"between minor versions."}]}]},{"t":"row","layout":"end","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/01-first-state","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Start → Your first state"}]}]}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"what-you-will-build","text":"What you will build"},{"level":2,"id":"before-you-start","text":"Before you start"}]}